  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Slice onion thinly; rub with lemon, half the salt and optional sumac.</li><li>Dice tomato to <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"mm\" data-a=\"5\" data-s=\"0\">5 mm</span> and drain excess juice.</li><li>Chop optional parsley.</li><li>Keep these ready before handling raw meat.</li></ul>",
