   "title": "Prepare the cold filling first",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>On a separate board, cut lamb across the grain into strips about <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"mm\" data-a=\"5\" data-s=\"0\">5 mm</span> thick and <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"3\" data-s=\"0\">3 cm</span> long</b>.</li><li>Pat dry; season with remaining salt.</li><li>Wash knife, board and hands before returning to the vegetables.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Slice lamb across the grain",
    "diagram": null,
    "diagram_title": "Diagram",
    "how": [],
