   "n": 3,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "7–9 min",
   "time_html": "<span>7–9 min</span>",
   "title": "Brown in two quick batches",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Warm each flatbread in the empty pan for 15–20 seconds per side.</li><li>Spread optional yoghurt, then divide lamb, tomato, onion and optional parsley between them.</li><li>Fold the bottom over the filling, tuck in both sides and roll snugly.</li><li>Serve immediately.</li></ul>",
